  "about": [
   "A personalised sticker experience created to bring creativity and self-expression into the Miro workspace.",
   "The project involved developing AI prompts to establish distinct illustration styles for personalised stickers that users could generate and add directly to their Miro boards. For Canvas 26, the experience was extended into a physical event activation, allowing attendees to create and print their own stickers on-site.",
   "I worked on defining the AI-generated illustration styles and designing the event booth, connecting the digital experience with a playful, interactive physical space.",
   "My role: AI Art Direction, Illustration Style Development, Event Booth Design",
   "* This project was developed as part of a collaborative creative team."
