  "about": [
   "Get Great Done is Miro's brand tagline, celebrating how AI-powered collaboration helps people achieve their own version of greatness — from creative breakthroughs to greater efficiency and better ways of working.",
   "The challenge was to translate this message into a distinctive visual lockup. By integrating Miro's recognisable AI sparkle into the typography, the design creates a direct connection between the tagline and the product's AI capabilities. I developed the visual lockup and a comprehensive set of brand guidelines, defining its structure, variations and applications to ensure consistency across different brand touchpoints.",
