 {
  "slug": "fun-and-fit-granola",
  "title": "Fun & Fit Granola",
  "tags": "Packaging Design, Art Direction",
  "thumb": "assets/img/card-granola.jpg",
  "hover": {
   "src": "assets/img/hover/hover-granola.svg"
  },
  "hero": {
   "type": "image",
   "src": "assets/img/projects/fun-and-fit-granola/hero.jpg",
   "w": 1516,
   "h": 953
  },
  "about": [
   "A fresh packaging concept for Fun&Fit's four-flavour granola range, designed to stand out on the shelf while highlighting the product itself. The central design feature is a custom-shaped cutout inspired by the form of a cereal grain, revealing the granola inside. Combined with a soft pastel colour palette and playful typography, the packaging creates a distinctive and recognisable product family.  The launch was supported by an outdoor campaign built around the message \"Beauty Is Inside.\" Oversized granola packaging became the visual inspiration for a series of citylight advertisements, bringing the product's signature design into the urban environment.  Following its launch, Granola achieved the fastest sales growth recorded within the Fun&Fit portfolio at the time.",
   "My role: Packaging Design, Visual Concept Development, OOH Design"
  ],
