  "about": [
   "LEPO is an event design studio specialising in thoughtfully curated celebrations, with a particular focus on weddings. The visual identity was developed around the idea of finding beauty in every detail. Elegant typography, organic shapes and delicate decorative elements reflect the studio's refined and personal approach to event styling. At the heart of the identity is a custom typographic logo inspired by intertwined ribbons and floral ornaments. A subtle connection between the letters \"p\" and \"o\" forms two interlocking wedding rings, introducing a meaningful detail into the design. The project includes a complete visual identity system, from logo development and colour palette to typography, brand guidelines and applications.",
